eator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135644187,imgsize-51170.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Goldie Hawn's MindUP helps 7 million children manage stress across 48 countries]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135601345.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Goldie Hawn established the Goldie Hawn Foundation in 2003 to support emotional awareness among children. MindUP, developed in collaboration with experts, integrates neuroscience and mindfulness into education. The program has reached over 7 million children across 48 countries since its inception. Lessons focus on emotional regulation, empathy, and stress management for children aged 3 to 14. With resources available online, families and educators can promote emotional development alongside academic learning.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2003-goldie-hawn-started-a-programme-to-help-children-manage-stress-and-understand-emotions-23-years-later-mindup-reports-reaching-more-than-7-million-children-across-48-countries-through-brain-based-lessons/articleshow/135601345.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2003-goldie-hawn-started-a-programme-to-help-children-manage-stress-and-understand-emotions-23-years-later-mindup-reports-reaching-more-than-7-million-children-across-48-countries-through-brain-based-lessons/articleshow/135601345.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T05:49:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135601700,imgsize-2129680.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Scientists find first Martian garnet in meteorite, but its origin remains unclear]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hsp