 cancer' stopped trick-or-treaters: What neighbourhood children did next left a mother overwhelmed]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135636760.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Zoe, a brave three-year-old girl, had to miss Halloween in 2020 due to her fight against cancer. To ensure she felt the spirit of the holiday, children from her neighborhood generously laid out candy on her doorstep. Their thoughtful gesture encapsulated the warmth of community, showing how acts of kindness can truly embody the spirit of togetherness during challenging times.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/child-with-cancer-stopped-trick-or-treaters-what-neighbourhood-children-did-next-left-a-mother-overwhelmed/articleshow/135636760.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/child-with-cancer-stopped-trick-or-treaters-what-neighbourhood-children-did-next-left-a-mother-overwhelmed/articleshow/135636760.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T04:48:00+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135636977,imgsize-1287679.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Man went from wheelchair to 285 kg deadlift after a devastating car crash]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135576332.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-stolen-car-left-him-with-devastating-leg-injuries-at-18-and-he-spent-six-months-in-a-wheelchair-decades-later-he-deadlifted-285-kg-and-became-a-world-record-powerlifter/articleshow/135576332.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-stolen-car-left-him-with-devastating-leg-injuries-at-18-and-he-spent-six-months-in-a-wheelchair-decades-later-he-deadlifted-285-kg-and-became-a-world-record-powerlifter/articleshow/135576332.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T05:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135576627,imgsize-117615.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Justice And Equality Fund: Emma Watson-backed drive aids 46,100; report urges sustained support]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135578193.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Emma Watson's active involvement with the Justice and Equality Fund has significantly bolstered initiatives combating sexual harassment across the UK. The fund has empowered over 20,000 professionals and donated almost £2.54 million to numerous organizations. With new legal obligations aimed at curbing workplace harassment, ongoing support for survivors and grassroots organizations remains critical. Collaborative efforts among charities and advocacy groups are vital for fostering enduring change.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/emma-watson-donated-1-million-to-a-uk-fund-fighting-sexual-harassment-its-impact-report-later-recorded-46100-women-and-girls-reached-over-20000-professionals-trained-and-59-grants-awarded/articleshow/135578193.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/emma-watson-donated-1-million-to-a-uk-fund-fighting-sexual-harassment-its-impact-report-later-recorded-46100-women-and-girls-reached-over-20000-professionals-trained-and-59-grants-awarded/articleshow/135578193.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T03:52:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135578287,imgsize-1301026.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A 1953 Leonora Carrington painting bought from a Mexico City gallery the year it was made has stayed with one family for more than 70 years; now authenticated, Fil d’Or goes up for auction on November 10]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135636224.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Fil d'Or is a unique artwork by Leonora Carrington with a fascinating backstory. It was purchased way back in 1953 and remained treasured by a single family for many years. This painting showcases a cool technique known as grattage, which is part of the Surrealist movement and provides insight into Carrington's distinctive and imaginative style. Now authenticated, Fil d’Or goes up for auction on November 10]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-1953-leonora-carrington-painting-bought-from-a-mexico-city-gallery-the-year-it-was-made-has-stayed-with-one-family-for-more-than-70-years-now-authenticated-fil-dor-goes-up-for-auction-on-november-10/articleshow/135636224.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-1953-leonora-carrington-painting-bought-from-a-mexico-city-gallery-the-year-it-was-made-has-stayed-with-one-family-for-more-than-70-years-now-authenticated-fil-dor-goes-up-for-auction-on-november-10/articleshow/135636224.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T03:45:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135636529,imgsize-1471815.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Former Las Vegas politician convicted over $70,000 police memorial fraud]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135538285.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-former-las-vegas-politicia